<title>BAHRAIN: National Import, Export H1 97 net doubles.</title>
<headline>National Import, Export H1 97 net doubles.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			(million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.7    vs    2.1</p>
<p> Total income	   5.0    vs    2.5</p>
<p> Expenses		 0.3    vs    0.4</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds 26.4    vs   23.1</p>
<p> Assets		  28.3    vs   26.9</p>
<p>Full Name: The National Import and Export Company.</p>
<p>Note - Traded on the Bahrain Stock Exchange, the firm imports and markets cement and white sugar. -- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
